      "kind": "input",
      "refersTo": "input",
      "description": "Rechercher un pseudonyme dans les préférences.",
      "html": "<label class=\"ds-field\">Rechercher un auteur<input class=\"ds-input\" type=\"search\" placeholder=\"Rechercher un pseudonyme\"></label>",
      "css": ".ds-field{font-family:var(--font-marr-sans,system-ui),sans-serif;display:grid;gap:6px;font-size:14px;color:var(--blm-fg,#263244)}.ds-input{font:inherit;font-size:16px;min-height:42px;width:100%;padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid var(--blm-line,#d7dce2);border-radius:4px;background:var(--blm-bg,#fff);color:var(--blm-fg,#263244);caret-color:var(--blm-accent,#075ba7)}.ds-input::placeholder{color:var(--blm-muted,#556173);opacity:1}.ds-input:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--blm-ring,#086bb7);outline-offset:3px;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Ligne d’auteur",
      "kind": "custom",
      "description": "Nom, provenance et choix de filtrage natif ; exemple synthétique.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-row\"><div><p class=\"ds-name\">Auteur de démonstration</p><p class=\"ds-hint\">Personnel · Pseudonyme exact</p></div><select class=\"ds-choice\" aria-label=\"Choix pour Auteur de démonstration\"><option>Toujours masquer</option><option>Toujours afficher</option><option>Retirer mon choix</option></select></div>",
      "css": ".ds-row{font-family:var(--font-marr-sans,system-ui),sans-serif;display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) 180px;align-items:center;gap:16px;padding:17px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--blm-line,#d7dce2);color:var(--blm-fg,#263244);font-size:16px;line-height:1.5}.ds-name{margin:0;font-weight:650;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.ds-hint{margin:4px 0 0;font-size:13px;color:var(--blm-muted,#556173)}.ds-choice{font:inherit;font-size:13px;min-height:38px;padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid var(--blm-line,#d7dce2);border-radius:4px;background:var(--blm-bg,#fff);color:var(--blm-fg,#263244);width:100%;cursor:pointer}.ds-choice:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--blm-ring,#086bb7);outline-offset:3px;}@media(max-width:720px){.ds-row{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) 160px;gap:10px}}@media(max-width:390px){.ds-row{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:8px}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Réglage à cocher",
      "kind": "input",
      "description": "Case native accompagnée d’un titre et d’une conséquence explicite.",
      "html": "<label class=\"ds-toggle\"><input class=\"ds-checkbox\" type=\"checkbox\" checked><span><strong class=\"ds-toggle-title\">Activer le filtrage</strong><span class=\"ds-toggle-hint\">Désactiver restaure les commentaires et conserve vos choix.</span></span></label>",
      "css": ".ds-toggle{font-family:var(--font-marr-sans,system-ui),sans-serif;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:10px;cursor:pointer;color:var(--blm-fg,#263244);line-height:1.5}.ds-checkbox{accent-color:var(--blm-button,#263b56);width:18px;height:18px;flex:none;margin:3px 0 0}.ds-checkbox:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--blm-ring,#086bb7);outline-offset:3px;}.ds-toggle-title{display:block;font-size:15px}.ds-toggle-hint{display:block;margin-top:4px;font-size:13px;color:var(--blm-muted,#556173)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Fenêtre de confirmation",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "dialog",
      "description": "Aperçu statique du conteneur de dialogue ; le piégeage et le retour du focus appartiennent au composant natif livré.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-dialog\" aria-label=\"Confirmation de masquage\"><header class=\"ds-dialog-head\"><h2 class=\"ds-dialog-title\">Masquer les commentaires de cet auteur ?</h2><button class=\"ds-close\">Fermer</button></header><div class=\"ds-dialog-body\"><p class=\"ds-author\">Auteur de démonstration</p><p class=\"ds-dialog-hint\">Ce masquage s’applique sur ce profil Chrome.</p><div class=\"ds-dialog-actions\"><button class=\"ds-cancel\">Annuler</button><button class=\"ds-confirm\">Bloquer cet utilisateur</button></div></div></section>",
      "css": ".ds-dialog{font-family:var(--font-marr-sans,system-ui),sans-serif;width:min(580px,calc(100vw - 32px));max-height:calc(100dvh - 48px);overflow:auto;border:1px solid var(--blm-line,#d7dce2);border-radius:8px;background:var(--blm-bg,#fff);color:var(--blm-fg,#263244);box-shadow:0 18px 60px #0003}.ds-dialog-head{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;padding:24px 24px 0}.ds-dialog-title{font-size:22px;line-height:1.4;margin:0}.ds-close{font:inherit;border:0;background:transparent;color:var(--blm-accent,#075ba7);padding:4px 2px;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px;cursor:pointer}.ds-dialog-body{padding:20px 24px 26px}.ds-author{font-size:18px;font-weight:650;margin:0;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.ds-dialog-hint{font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;color:var(--blm-muted,#556173);margin-top:14px}.ds-dialog-actions{display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;gap:12px;margin-top:24px;flex-wrap:wrap}.ds-cancel,.ds-confirm{font-family:var(--font-marr-sans,system-ui),sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.35;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;min-height:42px;padding:9px 15px;border:1px solid var(--blm-line,#d7dce2);border-radius:4px;cursor:pointer;background:var(--blm-bg,#fff);color:var(--blm-fg,#263244)}.ds-confirm{background:var(--blm-button,#263b56);border-color:var(--blm-button,#263b56);color:var(--blm-on-button,#fff)}.ds-cancel:hover{background:var(--blm-panel,#f5f6f8)}.ds-confirm:hover{filter:brightness(.93)}.ds-close:focus-visible,.ds-cancel:focus-visible,.ds-confirm:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--blm-ring,#086bb7);outline-offset:3px;}@media(max-width:720px){.ds-dialog-head{padding:20px 20px 0}.ds-dialog-body{padding:18px 20px 22px}.ds-dialog-title{font-size:20px}.ds-dialog-actions button{flex:1}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Résumé du filtrage",
